OL,3,GNEWSAShut slip roads will cause
OL,4,A'exceptional problems'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners say the two-year
OL,7,Fclosure of both slip roads of an M5
OL,8,Fjunction will cause "exceptional
OL,9,Fproblems".
OL,11,FJunction 10 near Cheltenham, which
OL,12,Fcurrently only allows drivers heading
OL,13,Fsouth to leave the M5 and those
OL,14,Ftravelling north to join, is getting a
OL,15,F#372m upgrade to enable motorists to
OL,16,Fleave and join regardless of their
OL,17,Fdirection of travel.
OL,19,FTo facilitate the upgrade, entire
OL,20,Fjunction will close in 2027 and reopen
OL,21,Fin 2029, when the new junction is
OL,22,Ffinished.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
