OL,3,GNEWSAShut slip roads will cause
OL,4,A'exceptional problems'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Peter Cassidy, managing director of
OL,7,Fnearby Cellar Supplies and Clavell and
OL,8,FHind Brewery, said: "It just seems an
OL,9,Fextraordinarily long time... it'll
OL,10,Fcause exceptional problems for us for
OL,11,Faccepting our customers and
OL,12,Fdeliveries."
